{"4065580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alfred's Alien Abduction Adventure", "steam_appid": 4065580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Alfred, an ordinary man in an extraordinarily <i>unfortunate</i> situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a close encounter that got a little too close for comfort, Alfred finds himself aboard a hostile alien mothership with one clear objective:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape. Stay alive. Avoid further... procedures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065580/extras/5ad5e38becd2f7e5b7a2f787292dba37.avif?t=1788172862\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065580/extras/e1fce3e88a5f704ff8c4b3f34d09e998.avif?t=1788172862\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065580/extras/33eb5307c5e5701fd79a1c60b9ccbbb2.avif?t=1788172862\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dangerous alien spacecraft filled with strange technology and unfamiliar design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve bizarre, thought provoking puzzles built by minds that definitely aren’t human</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, crawl, and sprint through tight corridors, eerie chambers, and hazardous environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid whatever else might be roaming the ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of tension and humour, where things can go from unsettling to ridiculous very quickly</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE ALIEN MOTHERSHIP </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped inside an alien vessel, Alfred must navigate a hostile but very <i>real</i> environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doors open. Corridors lead somewhere. Machines do… something. <br>The problem is figuring out <i>what</i>, <i>when</i>, and <i>why</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress comes from observation, experimentation, and the occasional leap of faith when something looks <i>just safe enough</i> to try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert. Stay moving. And try not to panic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE JOURNEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No chosen one. No grand destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just Alfred… <br>A spaceship… <br>And a very strong desire to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve already avoided one probing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let’s keep that streak going.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMPORTANT NOTE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alfred’s Alien Abduction Adventure</strong>   Proudly setting the standard as the world’s first <strong>quadruple-A</strong> experience.*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The fourth “A” stands for “Absolutely unnecessary.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Alfred, an ordinary man in an extraordinarily <i>unfortunate</i> situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a close encounter that got a little too close for comfort, Alfred finds himself aboard a hostile alien mothership with one clear objective:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape. Stay alive. Avoid further... procedures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065580/extras/5ad5e38becd2f7e5b7a2f787292dba37.avif?t=1788172862\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065580/extras/e1fce3e88a5f704ff8c4b3f34d09e998.avif?t=1788172862\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065580/extras/33eb5307c5e5701fd79a1c60b9ccbbb2.avif?t=1788172862\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dangerous alien spacecraft filled with strange technology and unfamiliar design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve bizarre, thought provoking puzzles built by minds that definitely aren’t human</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, crawl, and sprint through tight corridors, eerie chambers, and hazardous environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid whatever else might be roaming the ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of tension and humour, where things can go from unsettling to ridiculous very quickly</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE ALIEN MOTHERSHIP </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped inside an alien vessel, Alfred must navigate a hostile but very <i>real</i> environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doors open. Corridors lead somewhere. Machines do… something. <br>The problem is figuring out <i>what</i>, <i>when</i>, and <i>why</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress comes from observation, experimentation, and the occasional leap of faith when something looks <i>just safe enough</i> to try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert. Stay moving. And try not to panic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE JOURNEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\